<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on a basket of firms.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on a basket of firms.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) has issued four million American-style call warrants, in four equal tranches, on a basket of companies, lead managers Morgan Stanley Bank A.G. &amp; Morgan Stanley &amp; Co. International Ltd said.</p>
<p>The equally weighted basket includes shares of ABB B, Sandvik B, BMW, British Airways, Unilever, Grand Metropolitan, Novartis and SGS Thompson.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> TEN WARRANTS PER BASKET.	    PAYDATE	 02.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG	  MIN EXER LOT  1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1000 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE     MATURITY   STRIKE    ISSUE     PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> CALL     30.APR.99  1000 DEM  12.00 DEM 12.0 PCT  8.33 X</p>
<p> CALL     30.APR.99  1100 DEM  8.00 DEM  18.0 PCT  12.5 X</p>
<p> CALL     01.MAY.00  1000 DEM  15.4 DEM  15.4 PCT  6.49 X</p>
<p> CALL     01.MAY.00  1150 DEM  9.20 DEM  24.2 PCT  10.87 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
